---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="sYnX"
	description="A modern task management application built with Remix and powered by Cloudflare Workers Assets."
>
	<p>
		<strong>sYnX</strong> is a fast, responsive task management application designed to organize and track personal and professional responsibilities. Built as a serverless static asset application utilizing the Remix framework, it provides an intuitive user interface with robust offline-first caching and KV-backed server persistence.
	</p>

	<h2>Technical Stack</h2>

	<div class="specs-grid">
		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Application Layer</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Framework</td><td>Remix (React UI Engine)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Build Tool</td><td>Vite (using Remix Vite Plugin)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Language</td><td>TypeScript</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Styling</td><td>Vanilla CSS (Custom UI Components)</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Edge Deployment</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Hosting</td><td>Cloudflare Workers Assets (Static + Dynamic routing)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Database</td><td>Cloudflare Workers KV (KeyValue Storage)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Proxy binding</td><td>Cloudflare Developer Platform (Remix Dev Proxy)</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="lab-note">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
		<span>
			<strong>Remix Dev Proxy Binding:</strong> The developer setup utilizes Cloudflare's Dev Proxy to dynamically bridge bindings (such as the <code>TO_DO_LIST</code> KV namespace) directly into the local Remix Vite server during development.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Core Features</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Task Organization</strong> — Add, remove, edit, and categorize items based on priority levels and due dates.</li>
		<li><strong>Remix Routing</strong> — Utilizes Remix's nested routers to update specific sections of the dashboard instantly without full page refreshes.</li>
		<li><strong>Workers KV Persistence</strong> — High-speed reads and writes to global KV storage ensure task states load near-instantly regardless of location.</li>
		<li><strong>Cloudflare Assets</strong> — Deploys static assets globally, serving client files directly from Cloudflare's edge CDN.</li>
	</ul>

	<div class="tech-tags">
		<span class="tag">Remix</span>
		<span class="tag">Cloudflare Workers Assets</span>
		<span class="tag">Workers KV</span>
		<span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
		<span class="tag">Vite</span>
		<span class="tag">React</span>
	</div>

	<div class="back-link-wrapper">
		<a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.specs-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.spec-card {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(30, 35, 50, 0.5);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border-radius: 10px;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.spec-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.spec-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.spec-icon {
		color: var(--accent);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.spec-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.spec-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	.spec-table td {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.spec-table tr:last-child td {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.spec-label {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-weight: 600;
		width: 5rem;
	}

	.lab-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.15);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.lab-note svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-top: 0.15rem;
	}

	.tech-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.tag {
		padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.2);
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.back-link-wrapper {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.3);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.specs-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
